<sect1 id="release-4-1-11">
 <title>发布 4.1.11</title>
  <note>
   <title>发布日期</title>
   <simpara>2022-02-17</simpara>
  </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>变更</title>
  <itemizedlist>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-01-06 [4ed45b2c]
    -->
    <para>
     抑制 message length log for <varname>in_hot_standby</varname>. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     <productname>PostgreSQL 14</productname> introduced new config parameter <ulink url="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/14/runtime-config-preset.html">in_hot_standby</ulink>.
    </para>
    <para>
     该值对备用服务器为 "on"，对主服务器为 "off"。
     结果 pgpool 日志被以下消息淹没：
    </para>

    <programlisting>
     LOG:  reading message length
     DETAIL:  message length (22) in slot 1 does not match with slot 0(23)
    </programlisting>

    <para>
     为避免此问题，仅当参数名称不是 <varname>in_hot_standby</varname> 时才发出警告。
    </para>
    <para>
     此外，还增强了消息以显示参数名称。例如：
    </para>

    <programlisting>
     LOG:  ParameterStatus "TimeZone": node 1 message length 30 is different from main node message length 24
    </programlisting>

    <para>
     讨论: <ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-hackers/2021-December/004077.html">[pgpool-hackers: 4076]</ulink>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-02-10 [f114a2b2]
    -->
    <para>
     添加 validations of <xref linkend="guc-wd-lifecheck-password"> and <xref linkend="guc-recovery-password"> format (Masaya Kawamoto)
    </para>
    <para>
     <varname>wd_lifecheck_password</varname> and <varname>recovery_password</varname>
     are not allowed to be md5 hashed password format but pgpool just reported
     authentication failure and did not check them.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-02-13 [03a4df5e]
    -->
    <para>
     增强 parameter status handling. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     当参数状态消息从后端到达时，<productname>Pgpool-II</productname>
     将其转发给前端，而不仅仅是记住它。
    </para>
   </listitem>

  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
<sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-01-31 [6dae39f6]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 long standing bug with <command>pcp_node_info</command>. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     讨论: <ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-hackers/2022-January/004110.html">[pgpool-hackers: 4109]</ulink>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-02-02 [ea377d3a]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 health check process issues pointed out by <productname>Coverity</productname>. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-02-02 [aa55bc8e]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 memory leak pointed out by <productname>Coverity</productname>. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-02-06 [19a20fbf]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <function>failover()</function> to deal with the case when no former primary node exists. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     当 <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 启动时不存在主节点，
     <varname>Req_info->primary_node_id</varname> 为 -1 的情况下，
     <function>failover()</function> 跳过了调用
     <function>find_primary_node_repeatedly()</function>。
     同时 <varname>follow_master_command</varname> 也没有执行。
    </para>
    <para>
     讨论: <ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-hackers/2022-February/004114.html">[pgpool-hackers: 4113]</ulink>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-02-07 [71da51c8]
    -->
    <para>
     修复了示例故障转移脚本。(Bo Peng)
    </para>
    <para>
     此脚本没有考虑旧主节点 ID 为 "-1" 的情况。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-02-10 [3d04fdda]
    -->
    <para>
     修复了流复制检查进程在无法连接后端时不重试的问题。(<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=742">bug 742</ulink>)(Bo Peng)
    </para>
    <para>
     这种重试导致了长时间的故障转移。
    </para>
   </listitem>

  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
<sect2>
  <title>文档</title>
  <itemizedlist>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-01-04 [205c65e9]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 documentation typos. (pengbo)
    </para>
    <para>
     补丁由 Umar Hayat 创建。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-01-04 [beba0359]
    -->
    <para>
     添加 "exclude" settings to /etc/yum.repos.d/pgdg-redhat-all.repo so
     that <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> is not installed from
     <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> YUM repository. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-01-07 [924fcafd]
    -->
    <para>
     添加 restriction regarding <varname>ParameterStatus</varname> and <varname>in_hot_standby</varname> parameter. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-02-02 [228b6c1b]
    -->
    <para>
     添加 restriction about <varname>set_config</varname>. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
<sect2>
  <title>测试工具</title>
  <itemizedlist>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-02-06 [fc8c77b7]
    2022-02-07 [80eebc91]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <command>pgpool_setup</command> in failover script creation. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     当 <command>pgpool_setup</command> 创建 <filename>failover.sh</filename> 时，
     没有考虑不存在主服务器的情况。
    </para>
   </listitem>

  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
<sect2>
  <title>回归测试</title>
  <itemizedlist>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-12-22 [71d272a5]
    -->
    <para>
     允许 run regression test against existing installation without recompiling. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     讨论: <ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-hackers/2021-December/004078.html">[pgpool-hackers: 4077]</ulink>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-01-12 [c0fefaa7]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 regression test 075. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     即使 pgpool 未启动，测试也报告成功。
     问题由 Qiang Lingjie 报告并提供补丁。
     讨论：<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-hackers/2022-January/004086.html">[pgpool-hackers: 4085]</ulink>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2022-01-13 [6f086f72]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <command>pgpool_setup</command> and <command>watchdog_setup</command> binary PATH in noinstall mode. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>
