<sect1 id="release-4-1-8">
 <title>发布 4.1.8</title>
  <note>
   <title>发布日期</title>
   <simpara>2021-08-05</simpara>
  </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>变更</title>
  <itemizedlist>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-05-27 [7c69669]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 maximum length of hostnames including domain name. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     主机名的最大长度是 128，但正确的值是 254。
     讨论：<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-hackers/2021-May/003904.html">[pgpool-hackers: 3903]</ulink>
    </para>
   </listitem>

  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
<sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-07-07 [f3ad7cb]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 query cache to not cache <varname>SQLValueFunctions</varname>. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     <varname>SQLValueFunctions</varname> 的列表如下。
     <itemizedlist>
      <listitem>
       <para>
        CURRENT_DATE
       </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
       <para>
        CURRENT_TIME
       </para>
      </listitem>
        <listitem>
       <para>
        CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
       </para>
      </listitem>
        <listitem>
       <para>
        LOCALTIME
       </para>
      </listitem>
        <listitem>
       <para>
        LOCALTIMESTAMP
       </para>
      </listitem>
        <listitem>
       <para>
        CURRENT_ROLE
       </para>
      </listitem>
        <listitem>
       <para>
        CURRENT_USER
       </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
       <para>
        SESSION_USER
       </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
       <para>
        USER
       </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
       <para>
        CURRENT_CATALOG
       </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
       <para>
        CURRENT_SCHEMA
       </para>
      </listitem>
     </itemizedlist>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-07-09 [79ace39]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 client side hang when describe message is followed by NoData response. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     问题 reported and patch provided by Daniel van de Giessen.
     Discussion: <ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-hackers/2021-July/003951.html">[pgpool-hackers: 3950]</ulink>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-07-01 [1853b28]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 sending invalid message in SI mode. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     当查询因序列化错误等特定原因中止时，
     <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 会发送错误查询来中止
     在非主节点上运行的事务。该查询的消息长度
     不正确，导致后端出现 "invalid string in message" 错误。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-06-09 [4a012f8]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 orphan process is left when pgpool is going down. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     当执行 follow primary 命令期间 pgpool 正在关闭时，
     由 follow primary 子进程启动的某些进程可能会被遗留。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-06-08 [08d08a2]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <command>pcp_detach_node</command> leaves down node. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     使用 <command>pcp_detach_node</command> 分离主节点时，
     执行 follow primary 命令后，备用节点保持宕机状态。
     讨论：<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-hackers/2021-June/003916.html">[pgpool-hackers: 3915]</ulink>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-06-03 [abd8872]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <xref linkend="GUC-BACKEND-APPLICATION-NAME"> cannot be changed by reloading. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-05-22 [2b7cdea]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 watchdog communication race condition. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     当 watchdog 向主进程通知新消息，而主进程正在执行
     watchdog 进程通知的处理时，新消息的处理存在
     显著延迟。
     讨论：<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-hackers/2021-May/003901.html">[pgpool-hackers: 3900]</ulink>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-05-20 [1cebe5c]
    -->
    <para>
          修复 watchdog node status not updating after rebooting.
     (<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=684">bug 684</ulink>) (Muhammad Usama)
    </para>
   </listitem>

  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
<sect2>
  <title>文档</title>
  <itemizedlist>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-07-20 [2708725]
    -->
    <para>
     文档: add more explanation about <xref linkend="GUC-BACKEND-APPLICATION-NAME">. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-07-14 [7b676c8]
    2021-07-14 [bbe913e]
    -->
    <para>
