<sect1 id="release-4-1-7">
 <title>发布 4.1.7</title>
 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2021-05-20</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-05-19 [2a1153d]
    2021-05-18 [d4f54d8]
    -->
    <para>
     改进 sample scripts. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-05-12 [83906c5]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 regression test 018.detach_primary. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-05-11 [aece05f]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 race condition between <xref linkend="guc-detach-false-primary"> and <xref linkend="guc-follow-primary-command">. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     如果 <xref linkend="guc-detach-false-primary"> 和 <xref linkend="guc-follow-primary-command"> 同时运行，会出现很多问题。
     典型的问题是，最终找不到主节点。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-05-11 [241bee3]
    -->
    <para>
     文档: fix description about <xref linkend="guc-heartbeat-device">. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     它没有说明该参数只能在以 root 身份启动 <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> 时使用。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-05-10 [d24f075]
    -->
    <para>
     文档: enhance description on <xref linkend="guc-enable-consensus-with-half-votes">. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-05-10 [b582d76]
    -->
    <para>
     文档: remove incorrect description about <xref linkend="guc-failover-when-quorum-exists">. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-05-05 [049a1b6]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 broken database/app redirect preference in statement level load balancing mode.
     (<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=707">bug 707</ulink>) (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-04-30 [f1e2b71]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <xref linkend="watchdog-setup"> to create database cluster entity under pgpool0. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-04-09 [16d07f7]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 pgpool crash when query cache enabled.
     (<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=700">bug 700</ulink>) (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     <productname>Pgpool-II</productname> crashed upon receiving CloseComplete. This only happened in other than streaming and logical replication mode.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-04-05 [597a063]
    -->
    <para>
     改进 follow_primary.sh sample scripts.
     (<ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/mantisbt/view.php?id=694">bug 694</ulink>) (Bo Peng)
    </para>
    <para>
     运行 pg_rewind 后清空备用节点的 pg_replslot 目录，因为在旧版 PostgreSQL 中 pg_replslot 目录可能从主节点复制而来。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-04-05 [7d54c1b]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 that query cache is not created in other than streaming and logical replication mode. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-03-18 [4cd9f4a]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 hang with asyncpg. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-03-16 [f07fdb0]
    -->
    <para>
     增强 debug message upon receiving startup packet. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2021-05-09 [9971171]
    2021-05-05 [96578bd]
    2021-05-04 [69f3c9b]
    2021-04-20 [6150d26]
    2021-04-20 [d5469da]
    2021-04-18 [10b8241]
    2021-04-13 [b3bddbe]
    2021-04-06 [35fa87e]
    2021-02-20 [d9f25b8]
    2021-02-24 [b66801c]
    2021-03-06 [f5a8f26]
    2021-03-14 [30a7057]
    -->
    <para>
     文档: enhance documentation. (Tatsuo Ishii, Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>
