<sect1 id=release-4-1-4>
 <title>发布 4.1.4</title>
 <note>
  <title>发布日期</title>
  <simpara>2020-09-17</simpara>
 </note>

 <sect2>
  <title>变更</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-09-13 [88a4043]
    -->
    <para>
     遵循 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 12.4 关于扩展的指南。(Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     <command>CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION</command> should be avoided. Use <command>CREATE FUNCTION</command> instead.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-24 [4e8fece]
    -->
    <para>
     替换 "PGBIN" and "LPATH" in <xref linkend="PGPOOL-SETUP"> and <xref linkend="WATCHDOG-SETUP"> using PostgreSQL's bin path and lib path. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
<sect2>
  <title>错误修复</title>
  <itemizedlist>
   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-09-16 [957d3b3]
    -->
    <para>
     文档: fix the incorrect description regarding the running modes of Pgpool-II in which online recovery is available. (Bo Peng)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-09-14 [59367de]
    -->
    <para>
     移除 unnecessary checks in some code path. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     补丁由 Hou, Zhijie.
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-09-06 [9c0a5ff]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 relcache query sometimes sent to other than primary. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
     在流复制模式下，relcache 查询应该发送到主节点。
     但实际上，如果主节点不是 master 节点，它们不会发送到
     主节点。这通常发生在主节点不是节点 0 时。
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-09-01 [5bacc82]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 <xref linkend="GUC-CONNECTION-LIFE-TIME"> not working when <xref linkend="GUC-SERIALIZE-ACCEPT"> is enabled. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
	 讨论: <ulink url="https://www.pgpool.net/pipermail/pgpool-general/2020-August/007233.html">[pgpool-general: 7175]</ulink>
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-30 [c45cd0d]
    -->
    <para>
     在认证过程中显示更多信息性错误消息。(Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-22 [a070fda]
    -->
    <para>
     测试: Fix occasional 073.pg_terminate_backend test failure. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
   </listitem>

   <listitem>
    <!--
    2020-08-21 [2f14161]
    -->
    <para>
     修复 segfault in pgpool child process in certain case. (Tatsuo Ishii)
    </para>
    <para>
	 可以通过以下步骤重现此问题：
     <orderedlist>
	  <listitem>
	   <para>
        关闭所有后端。
	   </para>
	  </listitem>
	  <listitem>
	   <para>
        使用无效客户端连接到 pgpool。我使用了 pgpool 的端口号（而不是 pcp 的）运行 <command>pcp_attach_node</command>。
	   </para>
	  </listitem>
     </orderedlist>
    </para>
   </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
 </sect2>
</sect1>
